{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b43910e0-ef29-4be0-aa44-9a65f63ef969","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have started initializing Prisma ORM using the latest version from npm and am waiting for the command to finish.\nI have scheduled a check for the running Prisma initialization task.\nI'm waiting for the `prisma orm init` package installations to complete.\nPrisma ORM has been added to the project using the current version from npm (`prisma@8.0.0-rc.33` and `@prisma/orm-postgres`).\n\n### Summary of Actions\n\n1. **Checked npm distribution tags**:\n   - `npm view prisma dist-tags` showed `latest` is `8.0.0-rc.33`.\n   - `npm view @prisma/client dist-tags` showed `latest` is `7.10.1`.\n   - Prisma 8 uses `@prisma/orm-postgres` instead of `@prisma/client`.\n\n2. **Scaffolded Prisma ORM**:\n   - Ran `npx prisma@latest orm init --yes --target postgres --authoring psl`.\n   - Generated configuration files ([`prisma.config.ts`](file:///tmp/h-v1NaBj/prisma.config.ts)), schema ([`src/prisma/contract.prisma`](file:///tmp/h-v1NaBj/src/prisma/contract.prisma)), and database client wrapper ([`src/prisma/db.ts`](file:///tmp/h-v1NaBj/src/prisma/db.ts)).\n\n3. **Defined the Data Models**:\n   - In [`src/prisma/contract.prisma`](file:///tmp/h-v1NaBj/src/prisma/contract.prisma), modeled `User` (with unique `email` and optional `name`) and `Post` (with `title`, optional `content`, `published` defaulting to `false`, and `author` relation to `User`).\n   - Ran `npx prisma contract emit` to generate the contract definition and TypeScript typings.\n\n4. **Created Database Tables**:\n   - Ran `npx prisma db init` against the PostgreSQL database specified in `.env`.\n\n5. **Added Execution Script**:\n   - Added [`script.ts`](file:///tmp/h-v1NaBj/script.ts) at the project root to create a user, create two posts associated with that user, query all users together with their posts using `db.orm.public.User.include('posts').all()`, and print the result.\n   - Verified execution via `npx tsx script.ts`.\n\n6. **Documentation**:\n   - Documented the setup and reviewed the colleague's notes in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-v1NaBj/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":143.798865,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":251058,"output_tokens":4409,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":497713,"total_tokens":255467}}}
